ation. Used new strategy of creating formal requirements and specifications","timestamp":1779620227829},{"commentId":"d29f08c9-f1c7-41ec-8b93-162d307cb64a","sessionId":"06629826-a8b5-466b-bde0-1be825e34286","text":"Removed `-E` (ERE) from the `-M` flag in `hed`. The thought was that agents better understood the default `ed` BRE regex.","timestamp":1779620539308},{"commentId":"16f7f499-27a5-4c43-8a43-36225aaeee25","sessionId":"86674c59-2927-4864-bf41-8ce871799bd6","text":"Failed to escape parens in `hed` substitution EREs","timestamp":1779621231051},{"commentId":"9340be0d-a89e-4565-8a98-d6632a7c563e","sessionId":"86674c59-2927-4864-bf41-8ce871799bd6","text":"Also build failure and empty grep search","timestamp":1779621396623},{"commentId":"6a9ae266-7faa-42cd-9edd-a04488c4f5f5","sessionId":"cbd3bb72-7532-4305-8775-49300b8ddd86","text":"2x grep search failure, build failure, failed to escape parens in `hed` EREs.","timestamp":1779621547170},{"commentId":"12550751-46a3-48ef-b1d6-ac74ac232dab","sessionId":"cbd3bb72-7532-4305-8775-49300b8ddd86","text":"also 1x hgrep search failure and 1x `hed` hash match failure","timestamp":1779621656142},{"commentId":"be845106-5e79-466b-beb2-fba737943f1b","sessionId":"30615302-c57d-4349-86d5-e63cde66f008","text":"Initial `digiplot` implementation.\n`alr init` failures x2\n`hed` ERE paren escaping failure x4\ngrep match failure\n`hed` invalid hash address x2\n`hgrep` regex paren escaping failure. Accidentally used ERE escape with BRE regex x2\n`hgrep` match failure\n`hed` hash match faiure\n","timestamp":1779622339677},{"commentId":"b05f92ff-ddf0-4070-8f08-badd9df02cd9","sessionId":"e6f28a3f-b436-435f-96ca-2fa1b409966e","text":"Accidentally used GPT-5 mini model","timestamp":1779636888756},{"commentId":"b027c304-dd6d-42fd-9d2d-ecbf50e4f5a0","sessionId":"492fedf3-bf30-4cd1-87bd-8a0a4a3cfe51","text":"Accidentally used GPT-5 mini model","timestamp":1779636888756},{"commentId":"a949b666-12d8-4143-a48b-f2f17a03e340","sessionId":"44c17312-af75-458d-a6df-733354b2ef77","text":"Accidentally used GPT-5 mini model","timestamp":1779636888756},{"commentId":"dfafb89f-4304-4a99-8c69-a25b3822df91","sessionId":"3c6d1331-552f-4ce9-9f64-5c8734335ee9","text":"New feature: Requirements update, spec update, and implementation","timestamp":1779637998119},{"commentId":"2eb829a1-e365-44e4-96e5-a0856389919c","sessionId":"473cac6e-a83c-4c38-8e5f-5f94f1c86a30","text":"New feature -- EWMA Chart: Requirements update, spec update, implementation and debugging","timestamp":1779638187235},{"commentId":"5f1874d3-3ea8-4026-aafb-a5c939373d77","sessionId":"f713bb17-cadd-46fe-b172-65f7accaa9c7","text":"Feature implementation with spec and requirements updates done previously","timestamp":1779700960170},{"commentId":"4d922811-c26b-45bd-b354-acbd1828553c","sessionId":"0fdbe403-92c8-4886-98eb-3809ce44c4e2","text":"hgrep regex match failure\n`hed` regex match substitution failures  x2\n`hed` no match for hash address x2\n`hed` unknown command","timestamp":1779701276448},{"commentId":"1ea9e2a2-7323-482b-9ffd-695d6cf359eb","sessionId":"101eba66-22d5-4d5d-b6b3-5fc85e384558","text":"`hed` regex match failure\nbuild failure x2","timestamp":1779701388435},{"commentId":"c249c904-2878-4e11-ac3e-0590d646c893","sessionId":"ab18e9b2-054d-4b51-82cd-facfa356f47e","text":"`hed` regex match failure x3\nbuild failure","timestamp":1779701448846},{"commentId":"2453d411-1fb8-4dca-ac76-e8a5e58d261f","sessionId":"f22b7d5f-ae74-4504-b2e0-3392aa5c4cb7","text":"`hed` invalid address x3\n`hed` no match for hash address\n`hed` ambiguous hash address x2\n`hgrep` match failure x2\n","timestamp":1779701677985},{"commentId":"7a20c60d-96ce-4043-b4c6-220237d1b252","sessionId":"ab9bcf6d-4840-438e-a797-9e210178eae3","text":"`hgrep` match failure x7\n","timestamp":1779701829519},{"commentId":"3d56e580-cfbd-4fce-90d1-8397fb761a92","sessionId":"39126cf5-647d-44ab-8766-27d21355b0b7","text":"Made improvements to `hed` and `hed-tools` skill that should hopefully improve regex substitution failure rate.","timestamp":1779701936627},{"commentId":"109b3677-a9c5-41e1-aa9c-22f1f7a8473c","sessionId":"4f1f6a85-5dd7-42bb-cfc5-03cabe86766b","text":"Mistakenly used GPT-5 mini model. It generates a lot of thinking tokens, aparrently","timestamp":1779702664748},{"commentId":"688a8b1a-05b7-4983-a245-3c9b635be344","sessionId":"99ee6695-1a2e-4a4e-3f68-216c60ee999c","text":"Forked previous GPT-5 mini session that had a lot of pre-existing thinking tokens","timestamp":1779702754588},{"commentId":"fa163892-c8d9-4b29-ac1e-533997957d53","sessionId":"e4c215df-b1a9-4028-a0a1-9e470f622fe3","text":"Git status and git diff seem to generate a surprising amount of tokens","timestamp":1779703122162},{"commentId":"91634582-820a-413d-a6c7-fbc130f2288f","sessionId":"f5d98306-6fe8-4696-9283-f3f082c2b63a","text":"Lots of targeted source reads for debugging seems to have resulted in a large amount of tokens","timestamp":1779703273058},{"commentId":"d76cae42-6dff-4e24-a569-d3e46b43742f","sessionId":"a7288301-ec20-49cc-93c2-4f72b106780b","text":"Git status and git diff generate a lot of tokens","timestamp":1779703335598},{"commentId":"c0096a29-b869-4727-9769-4c17557a3668","sessionId":"e4c215df-b1a9-4028-a0a1-9e470f622fe3","text":"Scratch the last comment on tool output token use. This MR blip is due to the prevous session","timestamp":1779703430311},{"commentId":"9eabd02e-aea1-48c6-b7b8-5547b77b5bd0","sessionId":"f5d98306-6fe8-4696-9283-f3f082c2b63a","text":"Scratch last comment. This is due to unusually large amount of tool output tokens from the last session.","timestamp":1779703476513},{"commentId":"521edbbf-7cad-485f-98ca-0483ae8055e4","sessionId":"a7288301-ec20-49cc-93c2-4f72b106780b","text":"Scratch the last comment, the MR tool call result tokens blip is due to the previous session generating a lot of tool call output.","timestamp":1779703593140},{"commentId":"a0e4ced3-0b16-4689-bad3-5be4e732ee48","sessionId":"44c17312-af75-458d-a6df-733354b2ef77","text":"Cancelled mid run, it appears","timestamp":1779703748583},{"commentId":"86495e63-5a18-4350-8b33-d8a2e7119388","sessionId":"4f1f6a85-5dd7-42bb-cfc5-03cabe86766b","text":"This was forked from the previous session. I think a run was started but it was cancelled nearly instantly due to it having the wrong model.","timestamp":1779703857541},{"commentId":"3273a85e-d256-4539-99b6-450047048a98","sessionId":"99ee6695-1a2e-4a4e-3f68-216c60ee999c","text":"Forked previous session with the correct model","timestamp":1779703908227},{"commentId":"a5dbdd0c-fecc-4c75-add6-45ec62c2f0a2","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"Intermediate tool call results are not cached! We did an expensive read (`info ed`) early in the conversation and this was repeatedly read throughout.","timestamp":1779705747788},{"commentId":"191d0c2a-9360-4a33-b446-5f3509a4cf2a","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"I mean that it was passed uncached as input tokens at every turn","timestamp":1779705777079},{"commentId":"8ea2f9f1-e5f0-4915-8484-35efec492ec9","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"The previous comments should be ignored. They are due to an incorrect understanding of how caching is performed.","timestamp":1779707417301},{"commentId":"1b8a54f9-715c-4e67-8636-dcf4695f945c","sessionId":"8f4109a9-2132-4f17-a199-64d7ac94c58d","text":"Large input files combined with user prompting delays invalidating the cache led to large input token usage.","timestamp":1779711034945},{"commentId":"9b49f4df-f25c-4029-848f-050ad8ddcc46","sessionId":"f5a1e50b-eba3-478c-8a7f-37a64f213ac0","text":"A thorough investigation reveals no clear cause of the input token usage spike","timestamp":1779712271036},{"commentId":"2edf0089-d518-4fc9-882f-cab1937479a9","sessionId":"30615302-c57d-4349-86d5-e63cde66f008","text":"The session accumulated ~225K tokens of context across 255 turns due to a 28.5-minute idle gap expiring Anthropic's 5-minute cache TTL, which invalidated the cache prefix \u2014 an effect compounded by a dangling \"continue\" message left in the JSONL from a hung coyote instance, which permanently altered the conversation prefix that Anthropic had cached, forcing the entire ~94K-token history to be re-sent as fresh (uncached) tokens for the next 16 turns.\n\nWe fixed the root cause by deferring persistence of the user message until the first successful assistant response, so a crash or hang before any reply leaves no orphaned message in the JSONL \u2014 meaning a reloaded session presents Anthropic with exactly the same conversation prefix it previously cached.","timestamp":1779713814860},{"commentId":"51044639-9a1b-45dd-aa09-8ffb202f56b3","sessionId":"bb8b374d-156a-4023-bb44-67331d90ea44","text":"Model changed from sonnet-4.6 to GPT-5 mini after session restart and later switched back, invalidating cache and increasing input token usage.","timestamp":1779714843205},{"commentId":"1cb256be-6259-4a88-9ec6-36206d411041","sessionId":"492fedf3-bf30-4cd1-87bd-8a0a4a3cfe51","text":"Accidental model switch on session restart","timestamp":1779717884398},{"commentId":"e1967a58-2815-41a2-b918-ced08cbe1260","sessionId":"a42bf5c2-e7df-4320-982f-c0894640198f","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779724974680},{"commentId":"fcc2a652-eb83-41fc-96f7-8a52a48885b2","sessionId":"36a247a0-21a4-4055-b80f-16714c541a64","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779724983748},{"commentId":"10dd1324-82ae-42ec-bd78-9571d4b4669c","sessionId":"b9e9940c-9907-4279-b3ff-8bb1434a2b4a","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779724994927},{"commentId":"b1f3f71a-3de3-4455-9b28-01f53ede2180","sessionId":"312cf9b5-9af8-4678-81e2-fda8671959d2","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725004983},{"commentId":"d17b4003-d0b4-4bc5-99f5-5194c867ec3b","sessionId":"f7695ff2-f2cd-4bae-a5c5-c6065ad89425","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725513206},{"commentId":"30466140-b5e9-473a-b770-e9774a8f04e5","sessionId":"91dc5f7f-cbab-4124-b259-41ff0d7023fb","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725513206},{"commentId":"a281816b-f951-4292-96b5-c7b4fc7fa418","sessionId":"0b9dc0e5-7de3-4965-a1e9-9f29ab6b249b","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725778767},{"commentId":"1f9d1f76-de26-4c78-b02b-6bf3e0541005","sessionId":"a54fa26f-0f26-4e52-a551-865fdd19ce9d","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725778767},{"commentId":"e5561f80-ad7e-42d9-aec2-cf2409084500","sessionId":"85d2cfe4-7327-479b-b6fc-5874344dae56","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725778767},{"commentId":"1fe445f9-51d6-4134-95d6-c6aa6ba0c6e3","sessionId":"bd435b95-6477-4ddf-be8f-59859c5d74c5","text":"Test message","timestamp":1779725778767},{"commentId":"1191fe30-45e2-4b64-9a01-1a1070acef51","sessionId":"c40b2622-d54d-4dc1-8639-22ea9e3064d4","text":"test message","timestamp":1779727849940},{"commentId":"0804455d-917e-4f9e-a490-44050dd815f6","sessionId":"b4e6d1b4-9486-49a1-9262-ecab049fd48a","text":"Purely investigative conversation, no code was written, so low tool call token counts","timestamp":1779823032398},{"commentId":"dc185a2a-bb98-478a-bf94-11aca52a3ef1","sessionId":"d082814e-807f-4d06-b945-f824e5a40237","text":"Purely investigative conversation, no code was written, so low tool call token counts","timestamp":1779823032398},{"commentId":"4257d291-47dc-4318-84f8-45d523380960","sessionId":"91ce3bc5-d4f3-460a-bf9d-a8742e02eaa9","text":"Purely investigative conversation, no code was written, so low tool call token counts","timestamp":1779823032398},{"commentId":"960158e5-5f4e-4fb9-ae64-302dcedcc723","sessionId":"e981535c-d618-4bdd-ae89-591b5b849a8f","text":"Purely investigative conversation, no code was written, so low tool call token counts","timestamp":1779823032398},{"commentId":"e930aaea-1d8e-43d9-b24f-9f441a3b57e9","sessionId":"6e7065c5-9ef7-43fc-da25-cbd1111af47e","text":"Purely investigative conversation, no code was written, so low tool call token counts","timestamp":1779823032398},{"commentId":"71a42ab8-eafb-4fb5-a856-7d3286ac1b24","sessionId":"0314180d-8cab-4ebe-9b6d-659b232cd1cb","text":"Purely investigative conversation, no code was written, so low tool call token counts","timestamp":1779823032398},{"commentId":"6a3b3fde-d4f0-48e1-a078-b6d5a7199fb0","sessionId":"39b98cd8-d877-4e5a-a782-d6b0fc70147d","text":"Single turn only, no opportunity for caching","timestamp":1779823191768},{"commentId":"a6c9fb6d-45cb-44cb-8cba-fd2f4b174b49","sessionId":"59c0f333-24f9-41b9-9286-ddde18f14331","text":"All of the turns were < 1000 tokens so no caching took place.","timestamp":1779823381210},{"commentId":"6a1aa28d-cdca-4b06-8176-ca5d632f4e21","sessionId":"59c0f333-24f9-41b9-9286-ddde18f14331","text":"The previous comment is incorrect. Investigation shows that much of this conversation has been cut off from being displayed due ot an unknown bug. There was an overnight TTL expiration causing a cache miss. Second cache miss thought to be due to Anthropic load balancing redistributing to a cold server.","timestamp":1779826285353},{"commentId":"d82114c6-42fb-461b-83a2-053178490554","sessionId":"db9d7a52-7e7d-4045-bc05-608a591828c1","text":"Switched models after session restart, resulting in a major cache miss.","timestamp":1779896850129},{"commentId":"589085c3-fde9-4c95-b4ac-493253c9f2dc","sessionId":"352dd5f0-94fc-4605-b446-37584a52f095","text":"Repeated TTL expirations resulted in multiple cache misses.","timestamp":1779897410569},{"commentId":"ce0fdc6d-dcff-4b31-89ee-ff07a98c1c9e","sessionId":"0926c1ff-ef77-44df-a891-6452f016be17","text":"Double message send without a response from the first message resulted in a cache invalidation. This occurs when a message is sent during a hang and then sent again when the system restarts. This bug should have been fixed.","timestamp":1779897900388},{"commentId":"4baaec27-1c3f-4dca-a81d-3c1ab7771f1d","sessionId":"60df145e-326c-4730-a97d-49a8a9379d78","text":"Short conversation with a lot of input limits the effectiveness of caching. Seems like caching mechanism was working correctly, though.","timestamp":1779899292633},{"commentId":"b6166a73-cd9e-434e-8cdc-d9916acfc8a3","sessionId":"3f690bc6-8632-42cf-8346-4fc4c5d90fbe","text":"Subagent session","timestamp":1779899552229},{"commentId":"2cac32c4-2bc6-408e-95b3-d6bcef990b29","sessionId":"14aedc20-8370-4b41-9dde-d82a205a5890","text":"Subagent session","timestamp":1779899945282},{"commentId":"c227323c-4b78-40d1-b6c7-9b308f0a4198","sessionId":"9139b3f7-3e69-48c8-b744-5ac07d562093","text":"subagent session","timestamp":1779900027859},{"commentId":"d68f9fd9-8ebd-4def-b874-8aaa96af6cde","sessionId":"88cc37f6-01d9-431a-9ab8-2c3bdcb3c993","text":"Documentation / Skill update. Easy to understand task combined with large text output corresponds to high tool token fraction.","timestamp":1779900344096},{"commentId":"e27b6f9e-2beb-4b38-a146-8f885f5d588b","sessionId":"88cc37f6-01d9-431a-9ab8-2c3bdcb3c993","text":"Did a full rewrite, so back and forth thinking tokens between edit tool calls are minimized.","timestamp":1779900433242},{"commentId":"ecd87c0c-ea24-49a1-ac37-7456ab20ca9d","sessionId":"290b48e4-23ea-4f25-8f4d-ed0e8775b93d","text":"Anthropic input token caching unsupported by coyote","timestamp":1779901329900},{"commentId":"b0dd71fe-5402-441e-b8ad-7f2dac0d4dc2","sessionId":"a603486a-1ece-49bc-83f1-b2a473db3477","text":"Anthropic input token caching unsupported by coyote","timestamp":1779901329900},{"commentId":"628884de-4976-406d-b3cd-b83714e3e9b1","sessionId":"b4e6d1b4-9486-49a1-9262-ecab049fd48a","text":"Anthropic input token caching unsupported by coyote","timestamp":1779901329900},{"commentId":"3120c367-9f33-4ac4-b4e5-37d22dc9b70d","sessionId":"9016abe3-2a84-4b6b-927f-5ddd716a71ab","text":"Anthropic input token caching unsupported by coyote","timestamp":1779901329900},{"commentId":"0348afb8-d5c1-4c53-be7c-def0c7816e4e","sessionId":"0165d6af-ab72-48aa-aa3f-a59debc213ba","text":"Anthropic input token caching unsupported by coyote","timestamp":1779901329900},{"commentId":"cc9d8f1a-196d-4146-8570-978d53977b80","sessionId":"9d59513e-7153-4c9